PASS title search handles normalized whitespace and keeps failed list reads recoverable
PASS page failure preserves current content and retry deduplicates without jumping the reader
PASS late history page cannot replace another selected conversation
PASS rename failure retains its draft and a confirmed retry refreshes title
PASS archive failure keeps its row and late archive acknowledgement never clears another draft
PASS partial batch upload retains success, reports failures and stays with its draft
PASS cancel upload keeps prior successes and cannot send a half-uploaded batch
PASS upload limit is enforced before another batch is sent
PASS late accepted response preserves newer typing while transferring the new-conversation draft
PASS checking a hung accepted send releases the composer and its late response cannot clear a newer pending request
PASS unknown accepted response can be checked without losing edits or dispatching twice
PASS 404 leaves the request stable until explicit abandonment fences late submission
PASS stop acknowledgement remains pending until authority changes and never silently resends
PASS lost stop request stays unconfirmed and needs a read before another explicit attempt
PASS mobile dark recovery controls fit the viewport and preserve keyboard input
